abstract: "Paired whole-grain and ground-sample near-infrared spectra and reference chemistry for 98 independently coded sorghum samples, with reproducible model code, frozen repeated nested cross-validation results, retrospective selective-grinding analyses, and source data and programs for three manuscript figures. The prepared English publication derivative preserves numerical data and historical run receipts. It contains no independent external-validation cohort."
keywords:
  - sorghum
  - near-infrared spectroscopy
  - grain grinding
  - nested cross-validation
  - reproducible analysis
